WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
第 1 集 · 今天不要上班，咪养你
Episode 1 · No work today

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.160
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:21.370
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.090
你：乖宝给我亲一口
You: Come here, sweetie, give me a kiss.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.440
只能一口，小小的。
Just one. A tiny one.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.360
亲过啦，现在你要休息。
Kissed you. Now you rest.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.890
咪去做早餐啦。
Mii's off to make breakfast.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.830
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
These go this way. I knew that.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.860
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。不是故意的。
I tested the jam. With my paw. By accident.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:41.570
午饭得先买菜。买菜得先……穿条厉害的裤子。
Lunch needs shopping. Shopping needs... fancy pants.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.860
第 2 集 · 出门要穿得很可靠
Episode 2 · Dressed for the job

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.730
穿哪套呀？咪得看起来像知道鸡蛋在哪儿。
Which outfit? I need to look like I know where the eggs are.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:03.860
你：你想穿哪个，咪自己决定
You: Which one do you want to wear? Mii decides.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.840
咪来决定？好。
Mii decides? Okay.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:19.410
红蝴蝶结。很像大人。
The red bow. Very grown-up.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.880
帮咪穿上好不好？
Help Mii put it on?

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.280
很像大人。就是个头还小。
Very grown-up. Still very small.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:49.890
只有一个蛋。这个午饭有点小。你想吃什么呀？
We have one egg. That's not a very big lunch. What shall I make?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.500
你：我想吃过桥米线
You: I want crossing-the-bridge rice noodles

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.600
过桥米线？好高级。
Bridge noodles? So fancy.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.540
热汤对咪来说太难啦。
Hot soup is too big for Mii.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:13.420
不过面条，交给咪。
Noodles, though. Mii's on it.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:19.640
太大啦。这瓶水得自己开一辆车。
Too big. This bottle needs its own car.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:33.820
你乖乖休息。想咪之前，咪就回来。应该吧。
You stay cozy. I'll be back before you miss me. Probably.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.560
第 3 集 · 一只猫的采购清单
Episode 3 · One little shopping list

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:51.370
开一下嘛。咪很有礼貌地问啦。
Open, please. I asked nicely.

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:00.040
豆子？你不在名单上。对不起呀。
Beans? You're not on my list. Sorry.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:07.910
草莓还是蓝莓？它们都看着咪呢。
Strawberries or blueberries? They're both looking at me.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.600
你：樱桃
You: Cherries

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.270
樱桃？咪找找看。
Cherries? Let Mii look.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:27.070
没有樱桃。不过有草莓！
No cherries. Strawberries, though!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:34.170
红红的，甜甜的。咪就拿这个。
Red and sweet. Mii takes these.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.960
小顾客，需要帮忙吗？
Need a hand, little shopper?

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:42.010
要那小袋。这是咪的午饭。咪今天要养两个人。
That little bag, please. It's my lunch. I'm shopping for two.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.900
给你。真是个懂事的小帮手！
Here you go. What a thoughtful little helper!

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.840
咪这么短，收据怎么这么长。
That's a very long receipt for a very short cat.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:08.030
送货到啦！没有压扁的。咪也没有。
Delivery! Nothing squished. Not even me.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.200
第 4 集 · 这个锅，它不听话
Episode 4 · The pan had other plans

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:45.880
咪大厨准备好啦。大厨有一点点紧张。
Chef Mii is ready. The chef is a little nervous.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:54.200
意面下锅。计时开始。咪特别有条理。
Pasta in. Timer on. I am extremely organized.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.640
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce is sticking. Very attached to the pan.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:13.160
小火。哦。咪以为火大一点，午饭就快一点。
Low heat. Oh. I thought faster heat meant faster lunch.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.200
你：按照教程来做，加油！
You: Follow the tutorial. You can do it!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.820
跟着视频做，收到。
Follow the video. Got it.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:34.210
小火，画小圈。
Low heat. Small circles.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.120
味道对了，马上就好！
Smells right. Almost there!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:43.930
芝士，菠菜，意面。一个一个来，不许挤。
Cheese, spinach, pasta. Everybody gets a turn.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.850
午饭好啦！快来看。
Lunch is ready! Come see.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:04.910
成功的那份给你。
I made the good version for you.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.800
第 5 集 · 请这位客人认真吃饭
Episode 5 · Please enjoy your lunch

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:18.530
小小一口。咪吹过了。怕烫，吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. I blew on it. Twice, just in case.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.100
味道如何？
How does it taste?

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.760
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口。
You: So good! I want more. Feed me another bite.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.290
还要？咪好开心！
More? Mii's so happy!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:46.780
小小一口，吹凉了。
Tiny bite. Blown cool.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.370
好厨师可以摸摸头吗？
Good chef gets a pat?

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:07.520
吃完啦？那轮到咪啦。咪的肚子已经喊了好几遍啦。
All finished? Then it's my turn. My tummy has been making announcements.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:24.370
你去舒服地歇着。咪洗碗。碗也就比咪高一点点。
Go get cozy. I'll do the dishes. They're only a little taller than me.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.120
一滴。怎么长出一座泡泡山呀？
One drop. Why is there a bubble mountain?

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:48.290
哦。房子也想洗个澡。
Oh. The house wants a bath too.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:54.520
第 6 集 · 家里还有一只猫？
Episode 6 · A house full of little jobs

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:07.700
打扫的衣服。很严肃的口袋。没口袋？也很严肃。
Cleaning outfit. Very serious pockets. No pockets? Still serious.

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:15.520
纸巾！差一点，家里就要下雪啦。
A tissue! You nearly became snow. Indoors.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:40.570
还有一只橘猫？哦，是咪掉的备用毛毛。
Another orange cat? Oh. It's my spare fluff.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:06.140
你喝一小口。你还饱饱的？那好吧。
A little drink for you. You're still full? Okay.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:14.530
谁踩的呀？哦。保洁阿姨。就是咪。
Who walked here? Oh. The cleaning lady. That's me.

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:24.290
这个也要呀？好吧。吃晚饭的时候不许提。
Even this? Okay. Nobody mention this at dinner.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.960
休息时间。咪的爪爪已经投诉啦。
Break time. My paws have filed a complaint.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:52.350
第 7 集 · 咪只看一个视频
Episode 7 · Just one video

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:55.930
就看一个。给咪累坏的小脑袋放个假。
One video. For my very tired brain.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:14.770
这是学习。你看它的小短腿。忙得不得了！
It's research. Look at his little legs. They're so busy!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.270
你：你也学它跳一个
You: You dance like it too

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.090
咪也跳？好！
Mii dance? Okay!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:34.330
扭一扭，扭一扭，像柯基一样！
Wiggle, wiggle. Like the corgi!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.160
哦！衣服洗好啦！
Oh! The laundry's done!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:45.490
哦！衣服洗好啦。咪刚才很忙……忙着坐着。
Oh! The laundry. I was being very busy... sitting down.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:02.610
找到你的朋友啦。袜子要结伴出门。
Found your friend. Socks should travel in pairs.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.950
第 8 集 · 下午陪咪玩一局
Episode 8 · One round with Mii

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:12.140
玩一局吗？咪会一招。很厉害的一招。
Want to play? I know one move. It's a really good one.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.950
你：先出剪刀，再出布，虚晃咪一枪。
You: Scissors first, then paper. Fake Mii out.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:18.650
要耍花招？咪准备好了。
Tricks? Mii is ready.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:34.810
剪刀？不对，是布？！
Scissors? No, paper?!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:39.050
狡猾的人类。咪都看见了。
Sneaky human. Mii saw that.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:48.350
吃点水果吗？奖品是水果。每个人都有水果。
Snack break? You can win fruit. Everybody wins fruit.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:53.050
就吃水果，还是盖一条酸奶小被子？
Just fruit, or a little yogurt blanket?

00:12:56.590 --> 00:12:59.090
你：想吃草莓布丁
You: I want strawberry pudding

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:01.530
草莓布丁？好香。
Strawberry pudding? Yum.

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:15.840
布丁没有。酸奶也是软软的。
No pudding. Yogurt is soft too.

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:18.880
草莓酸奶，马上来！
Strawberry yogurt, coming up!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:24.530
你的有水果味。咪的……肯定不是水果味。
Yours is fruity. Mine is... definitely not fruity.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:31.030
咪只是让眼睛歇一下。它们今天也很努力。
Just resting my eyes. They're very hardworking eyes.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.730
第 9 集 · 晚饭这次有把握
Episode 9 · A better dinner plan

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:50.080
呀，晚饭时间啦。咪的眼睛放了一个大假。
Oh! Dinner time. My eyes had a whole vacation.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:57.270
先看。再做。慌张……菜谱上没有这一项。
Read first. Cook second. Panic... not on the list.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:05.860
这些是咪给晚饭留的。早上的咪很有远见。
I saved these for dinner. Past me was very helpful.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:13.860
小火。这个按钮咪认识啦。我们现在是朋友。
Low heat. I know this button now. We're friends.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:27.540
餐桌还是窗边？咪可以送餐。迷你送餐。
Table, or the window? I can do room service. Very small room service.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.230
你：去卧室吃吧，我想躺着，你喂我好吗？
You: Let's eat in the bedroom. I want to lie down. Will you feed me?

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.900
想躺着？咪喂你。
Lie down? Mii feeds you.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.100
卧室太远啦，窗边有软垫子。
Bed's far. Window has cushions.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:50.770
过来躺着，勺子在咪这儿。
Come lie there. Mii has the spoon.

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:53.980
真好吃，咪。你做得特别好。
That was lovely, Mii. You did so well.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:15:00.270
你喜欢呀？那咪去收拾啦。等会儿还能摸摸头吗？
You liked it? I can tidy up now. More head pats later?

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:17.820
给以后的点心。以后的咪会谢谢现在的咪。
Future snacks. Future me will say thank you.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:25.550
都做完啦。咪只忘了……什么都没忘！等咪看看。嗯！
All done. I only forgot... nothing! Let me check. Nothing.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:28.540
第 10 集 · 今天被养得很好
Episode 10 · Looked after, all day

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:30.540
制服脱掉。小老板下班啦。
Uniform off. Tiny boss is off duty.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:16.850
还要什么吗？水？被子？小一点的被子……给咪？
Anything else? Water? A blanket? A smaller blanket... for me?

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.540
你：你再帮我按摩一下吧，肩膀有点酸
You: Give me another massage? My shoulders are sore.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:23.560
按摩？咪的爪爪准备好了。
Massage? Mii's paws are ready.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.710
踩一踩，踩一踩。舒服点了吗？
Knead, knead. Feel better?

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:37.510
现在轮到咪要抱抱了。
Now Mii needs a hug.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:46.350
做得特别好。现在轮到我照顾咪啦。
You did wonderfully. Now it's my turn to look after you.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.940
晚安，我的小宝。
Good night, my little one.
